SCIENTIFIC ASSUMPTIONS: (1) 0.08 A displacement sigma as room-temperature thermal scale for oxides - reasonable but structure-specific. (2) SCF k-mesh 6x6x8 (denser along shorter c) - moderate density, not formally converged. (3) ecutrho=4*ecutwfc NC default. (4) occupations='fixed' assuming insulator.

