        "text": "STEP 1 verified: base.cif = 12 atoms (Ti4O8), MP ID mp-2657, SG P4_2/mnm #136. Reduced to primitive 6 atoms (Ti2O4), SG unchanged 136, 12%6==0. Wrote structures/base_primitive.cif. Now STEP 2: generate_structures.py. Plan: read base_primitive.cif, write structure_000 (unperturbed) through structure_050. Perturbations: room-temperature thermal displacement RMS ~0.05-0.1 A (Debye-Waller for oxides ~0.08 A per Cartesian component is reasonable), and small isotropic+shear lattice strain ~1%. Use rattle for displacements or np.random.normal. Assert nat=6, ntyp=2 per structure. First confirm ase.io.write CIF and Atoms.rattle signatures."
